{"message":"None of the available accounts can produce a valid referral bonus for your roommate if you are both registered at the same address. Rho-Bank prohibits referrals between people registered at the same address, regardless of the account selected.

If your roommate is registered at a different address, the best option for a paycheck of about $600 would be the Green Fee-Free Account: you would receive $20 and she would receive $35, for a combined $55, after she deposits at least $300 within 60 days. You must have been a Rho-Bank checking customer for at least 30 days.

For comparison, the Green Account would total $50 and requires a $500 deposit; Evergreen and Dark Green require deposits above $600. Gold Years requires the applicant to be at least 62 and a $1,000 deposit. Referral bonuses also cannot be combined with another new-account promotion, and the qualifying funds must be new money and remain deposited for the required retention period."}
